    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>General Feat (Prerequisite: Level 4+, Upper Planes Pact Feat)</em></p><p>The tranquility and serenity of Elysium grant you the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> Increase your Intelligence, Wisdom, or Charisma score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p><p><strong>Celestial Communicator.</strong> You learn two additional languages of your choice from the Player's Handbook language tables.</p><p><strong>Divine Calm.</strong> A creature's Hostile attitude toward you doesn't impose Disadvantage on your Charisma (Persuasion) checks to influence it.</p><p><strong>Quick Retreat.</strong> When an enemy ends its turn within 5 feet of you, you can take a Reaction to move up to half your Speed without provoking Opportunity Attacks.</p>",
